      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This paraphrase of Psalms 49 in English verse by Sir Robert Grant was first published under the title “Psalm XLIX. Imitated.” without attribution in <tei:hi rend="italic">Poems Divine and Moral: Many of Them Now First Published</tei:hi> (ed. John Bowdler, 1821), pp. 59-61. It was later published posthumously by Robert’s brother Charles Grant (Lord Glenelg) in <tei:hi rend="italic">Sacred Poems by the Late Right Hon. Sir Robert Grant</tei:hi> (1839), pp. 22-24.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
